      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my jaw and neck have been feeling really heavy and tight for the last hour. it's kind of a dull thing. i don't have any chest pain or anything so it's probably just tension from sitting at my desk too long or maybe my teeth grinding. you think it's just muscle stiffness or something like that?",
